  'A wide 120° field of view (FOV) expands the VR viewing experience.
            The increased angle better aligns with the human eyes, letting you
            see more naturally.' => 'Góc nhìn (FOV) rộng 120° (FOV) mở rộng trải nghiệm xem VR.
